Withdraw_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when units zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
├── when adapter not authorized on midnight
│  └── it should revert in midnight
└── when authorized and funded
   ├── it should burn the vault credit
   ├── it should transfer loan token to the vault
   └── it should emit MidnightMarketAction withdraw
